# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GranularStory .gitignore
#
# Layman note: git is not built for huge binary files. GitHub rejects any single
# file over 100MB. Our models/ folder is about 14GB of trained weights, so it is
# excluded here and backed up separately (see README).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Trained model weights (about 14GB total, far over GitHub limits) ---
# These are regenerable by re-running src/3_training/. The adapters we actually
# need for the paper are listed in README under "Model artifacts".
models/

# --- Training checkpoints and logs ---
logs/
*.log
runs/
wandb/

# --- Duplicate of the root-level files, created by a browser download ---
# Verified byte-identical to CLAUDE_CODE_PROMPT.md, make_figures.py and Fig1..4.
"files (2)/"
files (2)/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# --- Virtual environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- Jupyter ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Hugging Face / torch caches (can appear inside the project dir) ---
.cache/
huggingface/
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# --- Secrets (none present today, this is a guard for later) ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
token.json

# --- OS and editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- Experiment run outputs ---
# Partial CSVs are crash-recovery scratch files, the final results.csv is kept.
experiments/**/partial_results.csv
experiments/**/run.log
